-sm\">database</span>\n<span class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase\">GraphQL</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm\">speed</span>\n<span class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase\">Performance</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-secondary group-hover:text-tertiary transition-colors font-label text-xs tracking-widest uppercase\" href=\"#\">\n                        View Manifest <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm\">arrow_forward</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Bento Grid Skills / Stats -->\n<section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-32\">\n<div class=\"md:col-span-2 glass-panel p-10 border border-outline-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:bg-white/5 transition-all\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-3xl mb-12\">terminal</span>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Technical Prowess</h4>\n<p class=\"text-on-surface-variant font-light\">TypeScript, Rust, Three.js, and Distributed Systems.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-panel p-10 border border-outline-variant/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group hover:bg-white/5 transition-all\">\n<div class=\"text-5xl font-display font-black text-tertiary mb-2 text-glow\">09</div>\n<div class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-outline\">Years Active</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-panel p-10 border border-outline-variant/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group hover:bg-white/5 transition-all\">\n<div class=\"text-5xl font-display font-black text-secondary mb-2 text-glow\">42</div>\n<div class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-outline\">Modules Deployed</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center px-12 gap-