tesk\"],\n                    \"body\": [\"Be Vietnam Pro\"],\n                    \"label\": [\"Fira Code\"]\n            }\n          },\n        },\n      }\n    </script>\n<style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #070e19;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n        .glass-panel {\n            background: rgba(25, 32, 43, 0.6);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(150%);\n        }\n        .starfield {\n            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 0);\n            background-size: 40px 40px;\n        }\n        .nebula-glow {\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\n        }\n        .solar-flare {\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(255, 185, 95, 0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);\n            filter: blur(80px);\n        }\n        .drift-animation-slow {\n            animation: drift 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n        }\n        @keyframes drift {\n            from { transform: translate(0, 0); }\n            to { transform: translate(20px, -20px); }\n        }\n    </style>\n<style>\n    body {\n      min-height: max(884px, 100dvh);\n    }\n  </style>\n  </head>\n<body class=\"font-body text-on-background selection:bg-primary/30 min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n<!-- Global Background Elements -->\n<div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-1] overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 starfield opacity-40\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute top-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[600px] h-[600px] solar-flare\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-[-20%] left-[-10%] w-[800px] h-[800px] nebula-glow drift-animation-slow\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Navigation Shell (TopAppBar) -->\n<header class=\"fixed top-0 w-full z-50 flex justify-between items-center px-8 h-20 max-w-[100vw] bg-[#19202b]/60 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(124,58,237,0.08)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-violet-400\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\">rocket_launch</span>\n<span class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-400 to-cyan-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(124,58,237,0.5)] font-['Space_Grotesk'] uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\">NEBULA_OS</span>\n</div>\n<nav class=\"hidden md:flex gap-12 text-sm font-label tracking-widest\">\n<a class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors duration-500\" href=\"#\">TERMINAL</a>\n<a class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors duration-500\" href=\"#\">COORDINATES</a>\n<a class=\"text-cyan-400 font-bold border-b-2 border-cyan-400 pb-1\" href=\"#\">ESTABLISH_CONNECTION</a>\n</nav>\n<button class=\"text-violet-400 hover:bg-white/5 p-2 rounded-full transition-all\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">menu</span>\n</button>\n</header>\n<!-- Main Content Canvas -->\n<main class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center px-6 pt-32 pb-24 relative z-10\">\n<div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start\">\n<!-- Hero Title Section -->\n<div class=\"lg:col-span-5 space-y-8 lg:sticky lg:top-32\">\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"font-headline text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-4\">\n<span class=\"block text-surface-tint\">ESTABLISH_</span>\n<span class=\"block text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-primary-container\">CONNECTION</span>\n</h1>\n<div class=\"h-1 w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-transparent\"></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-on-surface-variant text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n                    Initiate secure transmission across the digital void. Your signal will be prioritized through the Orion relay cluster for immediate processing.\n                </p>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 pt-4 font-label text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-outline\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-outline-variant flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-secondary transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-lg\">router</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-secondary opacity-70\">ENCRYPTION_PROTOCOL</p>\n<p class=\"text-on-surface\">AES-256 BIT QUANTUM-SAFE</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-outline-variant flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-secondary transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-lg\">hub</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-secondary opacity-70\">SIGNAL_ROUTING</p>\n<p class=\"text-on-surface\">VOYAGER-6 RELAY HUB</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Contact Form Section -->\n<div class=\"lg:col-span-7 w-full\">\n<div class=\"glass-panel p-8 md:p-12 rounded-xl relative overflow-hidden group\">\n<!-- Subtle Interior Glow -->\n<div class=\"absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<form action=\"#\" class=\"space-y-8 relative z-10\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n<div class=\"space-y-2 group/input\">\n<label class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest text-secondary group-focus-within/input:text-primary transition-colors\">SENDER_ID</label>\n<input class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-b border-outline-variant py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary transition-all placeholder:text-outline/40 text-on-surface\" placeholder=\"John_Doe_Alpha\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-2 group/input\">\n<label class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest text-secondary group-focus-within/input:text-primary transition-colors\">SIGNAL_ORIGIN</label>\n<input class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-b border-outline-variant py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary transition-all placeholder:text-outline/40 text-on-surface\" placeholder=\"identity@nexus.void\" type=\"email\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-2 group/input\">\n<label class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest text-secondary group-focus-within/input:text-primary transition-colors\">TRANSMISSION_SUBJECT</label>\n<select class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-b border-outline-variant py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary transition-all text-on-surface appearance-none cursor-pointer\">\n<option class=\"bg-surface-container\">PROJECT_COLLABORATION</option>\n<option class=\"bg-surface-container\">TECHNICAL_INQUIRY</option>\n<option class=\"bg-surface-container\">SYSTEM_FEEDBACK</option>\n<option class=\"bg-surface-container\">GENERAL_SIGNAL</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-2 group/input\">\n<label class=\"font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest text-secondary group-focus-within/input:text-primary transition-colors\">ENCODED_MESSAGE</label>\n<textarea class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-b border-outline-variant py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary transition-all placeholder:text-outline/40 text-on-surface resize-none\" placeholder=\"Begin sequence input...\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-6\">\n<div class=\"hidden md:flex flex-col gap-1\">\n<span class=\"font-label text-[9px] text-outline tracking-[0.3em]\">SYSTEM_STATUS</span>\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-label text-[9px] text-tertiary\">\n<span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,185,95,0.8)]\"></span>\n                                    READY_TO_TRANSMIT\n                                </span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"relative group/btn overflow-hidden px-10 py-4 rounded-full transition-all\" type=\"submit\">\n<!-- Glowing Background -->\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-container to-secondary transition-transform group-hover/btn:scale-110\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-0 group-hover/btn:opacity-20 transition-opacity\"></div>\n<span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3 font-label font-bold text-on-primary tracking-widest\">\n                                    SUBMIT_TRANSMISSION\n                                    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-lg\">send</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</form>\n</div>\n<!-- Secondary Cards / Bento Details -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n<div class=\"glass-panel p-6 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-4 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-500\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary\">location_on</span>\n<div>\n<p class=\"font-label text-[10px] text-tertiary tracking-widest mb-1\">STATION_COORDINATES</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium\">NECTOR_QUADRANT_42 / SECTOR-7G</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-panel p-6 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-4 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-500\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary\">public</span>\n<div>\n<p class=\"font-label text-[10px] text-secondary tracking-widest mb-1\">SIGNAL_UPTIME</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium\">99.998% INTERSTELLAR RELIABILITY</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<!-- Decorative Image Component (Orbital Visual) -->\n<div class=\"fixed bottom-0 right-0 w-[40vw] h-[353px] opacity-20 pointer-events-none z-0\">\n<img alt=\"Vibrant space nebula with swirling violet and cyan gases and distant bright stars\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover mask-gradient\" data-alt=\"Stunning deep space nebula with high-contrast violet and teal cosmic dust clouds and brilliant distant solar systems\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDh6iPgiAm8RauMx9nlX4fGwloP6WtCJDL8AVmyGGaNWjmXC_FW1yY90KRBiAhFP22lnigv-d3w2NXJDeSNtNSv6LrV9kJtRnGV4rz3WZqpk_tJN4yypqCrM8rVxLtyda4U20OPM_hIrWHNtjceFuxBlR3v_xW0xtOXy7THkiNc966XCppN97Zc4mjq-iLyiBKdmJ4TDCPcUns5O6cfrLMvK9mAO1j9kFZ9BnH